  "batch_edn": "{\"source\" \":agent/codex\" \"forms\" [[:db/add \"fad669bf-e90e-543e-be08-273a10645ddd\" :answer/id #uuid \"fad669bf-e90e-543e-be08-273a10645ddd\"] [:db/add \"fad669bf-e90e-543e-be08-273a10645ddd\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"fad669bf-e90e-543e-be08-273a10645ddd\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"fad669bf-e90e-543e-be08-273a10645ddd\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"fb004aaa-7d4c-5eae-9eb7-e4d0823539b6\" :answer/id #uuid \"fb004aaa-7d4c-5eae-9eb7-e4d0823539b6\"] [:db/add \"fb004aaa-7d4c-5eae-9eb7-e4d0823539b6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"fb004aaa-7d4c-5eae-9eb7-e4d0823539b6\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{10}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"fb004aaa-7d4c-5eae-9eb7-e4d0823539b6\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"9ead6177-d303-5cab-b8ea-a5219cccb094\" :answer/id #uuid \"9ead6177-d303-5cab-b8ea-a5219cccb094\"] [:db/add \"9ead6177-d303-5cab-b8ea-a5219cccb094\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"9ead6177-d303-5cab-b8ea-a5219cccb094\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{6}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"9ead6177-d303-5cab-b8ea-a5219cccb094\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"6b59afd9-f2c2-5e5e-9970-6f992e37ea86\" :answer/id #uuid \"6b59afd9-f2c2-5e5e-9970-6f992e37ea86\"] [:db/add \"6b59afd9-f2c2-5e5e-9970-6f992e37ea86\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"6b59afd9-f2c2-5e5e-9970-6f992e37ea86\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"6b59afd9-f2c2-5e5e-9970-6f992e37ea86\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"b1ec166a-a9bc-539d-9701-76c30fbff55b\" :answer/id #uuid \"b1ec166a-a9bc-539d-9701-76c30fbff55b\"] [:db/add \"b1ec166a-a9bc-539d-9701-76c30fbff55b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b1ec166a-a9bc-539d-9701-76c30fbff55b\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"b1ec166a-a9bc-539d-9701-76c30fbff55b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\"] [:db/add \"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/choices \"fad669bf-e90e-543e-be08-273a10645ddd\"] [:db/add \"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/choices \"fb004aaa-7d4c-5eae-9eb7-e4d0823539b6\"] [:db/add \"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/choices \"9ead6177-d303-5cab-b8ea-a5219cccb094\"] [:db/add \"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/choices \"6b59afd9-f2c2-5e5e-9970-6f992e37ea86\"] [:db/add \"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/choices \"b1ec166a-a9bc-539d-9701-76c30fbff55b\"] [:db/add \"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/correct \"fad669bf-e90e-543e-be08-273a10645ddd\"] [:db/ensure \"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"67653320-5f1a-514c-9009-48894d1fa597\" :question/id #uuid \"67653320-5f1a-514c-9009-48894d1fa597\"] [:db/add \"67653320-5f1a-514c-9009-48894d1fa597\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=5 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{10}} \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"67653320-5f1a-514c-9009-48894d1fa597\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{3}{5}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{1}{10}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{10}} \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"67653320-5f1a-514c-9009-48894d1fa597\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"67653320-5f1a-514c-9009-48894d1fa597\" :question/answer-fields \"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\"] [:db/ensure \"67653320-5f1a-514c-9009-48894d1fa597\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"67653320-5f1a-514c-9009-48894d1fa597\"] [:db/add \"03d5b975-d657-53f4-8d36-078f875960bb\" :answer/id #uuid \"03d5b975-d657-53f4-8d36-078f875960bb\"] [:db/add \"03d5b975-d657-53f4-8d36-078f875960bb\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"03d5b975-d657-53f4-8d36-078f875960bb\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"03d5b975-d657-53f4-8d36-078f875960bb\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d08db519-79ee-52a5-bffc-d68c86a11848\" :answer/id #uuid \"d08db519-79ee-52a5-bffc-d68c86a11848\"] [:db/add \"d08db519-79ee-52a5-bffc-d68c86a11848\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d08db519-79ee-52a5-bffc-d68c86a11848\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"d08db519-79ee-52a5-bffc-d68c86a11848\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"4f1fbc1f-a7b4-5aa0-aab7-92081dbdffa5\" :answer/id #uuid \"4f1fbc1f-a7b4-5aa0-aab7-92081dbdffa5\"] [:db/add \"4f1fbc1f-a7b4-5aa0-aab7-92081dbdffa5\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"4f1fbc1f-a7b4-5aa0-aab7-92081dbdffa5\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"4f1fbc1f-a7b4-5aa0-aab7-92081dbdffa5\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"fe6e30ab-f88f-59d9-bc5e-71c102d0efd6\" :answer/id #uuid \"fe6e30ab-f88f-59d9-bc5e-71c102d0efd6\"] [:db/add \"fe6e30ab-f88f-59d9-bc5e-71c102d0efd6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"fe6e30ab-f88f-59d9-bc5e-71c102d0efd6\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"fe6e30ab-f88f-59d9-bc5e-71c102d0efd6\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"6d7bdd9f-7915-5cbd-b87c-3174d06d5ecf\" :answer/id #uuid \"6d7bdd9f-7915-5cbd-b87c-3174d06d5ecf\"] [:db/add \"6d7bdd9f-7915-5cbd-b87c-3174d06d5ecf\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"6d7bdd9f-7915-5cbd-b87c-3174d06d5ecf\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"6d7bdd9f-7915-5cbd-b87c-3174d06d5ecf\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\"] [:db/add \"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/choices \"03d5b975-d657-53f4-8d36-078f875960bb\"] [:db/add \"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/choices \"d08db519-79ee-52a5-bffc-d68c86a11848\"] [:db/add \"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/choices \"4f1fbc1f-a7b4-5aa0-aab7-92081dbdffa5\"] [:db/add \"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/choices \"fe6e30ab-f88f-59d9-bc5e-71c102d0efd6\"] [:db/add \"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/choices \"6d7bdd9f-7915-5cbd-b87c-3174d06d5ecf\"] [:db/add \"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/correct \"4f1fbc1f-a7b4-5aa0-aab7-92081dbdffa5\"] [:db/ensure \"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"ae0341c2-7c53-5699-a7a5-3b8f281ae54b\" :question/id #uuid \"ae0341c2-7c53-5699-a7a5-3b8f281ae54b\"] [:db/add \"ae0341c2-7c53-5699-a7a5-3b8f281ae54b\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=3 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{3}} \\\\frac{2}{9 x^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"ae0341c2-7c53-5699-a7a5-3b8f281ae54b\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=\\\\frac{2}{3}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{1}{3}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{3}} \\\\frac{2}{9 x^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"ae0341c2-7c53-5699-a7a5-3b8f281ae54b\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"ae0341c2-7c53-5699-a7a5-3b8f281ae54b\" :question/answer-fields \"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\"] [:db/ensure \"ae0341c2-7c53-5699-a7a5-3b8f281ae54b\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"ae0341c2-7c53-5699-a7a5-3b8f281ae54b\"] [:db/add \"377d4f69-27e2-54f3-a7e1-e385bb72ca97\" :answer/id #uuid \"377d4f69-27e2-54f3-a7e1-e385bb72ca97\"] [:db/add \"377d4f69-27e2-54f3-a7e1-e385bb72ca97\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"377d4f69-27e2-54f3-a7e1-e385bb72ca97\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"377d4f69-27e2-54f3-a7e1-e385bb72ca97\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"5de935b1-d3a2-5a43-a05c-9e9fbcd319db\" :answer/id #uuid \"5de935b1-d3a2-5a43-a05c-9e9fbcd319db\"] [:db/add \"5de935b1-d3a2-5a43-a05c-9e9fbcd319db\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"5de935b1-d3a2-5a43-a05c-9e9fbcd319db\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"5de935b1-d3a2-5a43-a05c-9e9fbcd319db\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"9340851e-1c58-561c-9176-5e23ee1c80dd\" :answer/id #uuid \"9340851e-1c58-561c-9176-5e23ee1c80dd\"] [:db/add \"9340851e-1c58-561c-9176-5e23ee1c80dd\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"9340851e-1c58-561c-9176-5e23ee1c80dd\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"9340851e-1c58-561c-9176-5e23ee1c80dd\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"00f269bf-7d07-5172-b58e-2a6c8250fa4e\" :answer/id #uuid \"00f269bf-7d07-5172-b58e-2a6c8250fa4e\"] [:db/add \"00f269bf-7d07-5172-b58e-2a6c8250fa4e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"00f269bf-7d07-5172-b58e-2a6c8250fa4e\" :answer/value \"\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [:db/ensure \"00f269bf-7d07-5172-b58e-2a6c8250fa4e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ed9fc151-9572-55a9-a4bf-15ee53910c58\" :answer/id #uuid \"ed9fc151-9572-55a9-a4bf-15ee53910c58\"] [:db/add \"ed9fc151-9572-55a9-a4bf-15ee53910c58\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ed9fc151-9572-55a9-a4bf-15ee53910c58\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"ed9fc151-9572-55a9-a4bf-15ee53910c58\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\"] [:db/add \"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/choices \"377d4f69-27e2-54f3-a7e1-e385bb72ca97\"] [:db/add \"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/choices \"5de935b1-d3a2-5a43-a05c-9e9fbcd319db\"] [:db/add \"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/choices \"9340851e-1c58-561c-9176-5e23ee1c80dd\"] [:db/add \"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/choices \"00f269bf-7d07-5172-b58e-2a6c8250fa4e\"] [:db/add \"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/choices \"ed9fc151-9572-55a9-a4bf-15ee53910c58\"] [:db/add \"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/correct \"00f269bf-7d07-5172-b58e-2a6c8250fa4e\"] [:db/ensure \"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646\" :question/id #uuid \"6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646\"] [:db/add \"6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=2 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{4}} \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 4 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}=1$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{1}{4}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{4}} \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 4 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646\" :question/answer-fields \"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\"] [:db/ensure \"6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646\"] [:db/add \"5d231189-769b-5732-ace7-6461f3b15312\" :answer/id #uuid \"5d231189-769b-5732-ace7-6461f3b15312\"] [:db/add \"5d231189-769b-5732-ace7-6461f3b15312\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"5d231189-769b-5732-ace7-6461f3b15312\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"5d231189-769b-5732-ace7-6461f3b15312\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"fa4fd602-fb90-5466-9105-9362a34b9033\" :answer/id #uuid \"fa4fd602-fb90-5466-9105-9362a34b9033\"] [:db/add \"fa4fd602-fb90-5466-9105-9362a34b9033\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"fa4fd602-fb90-5466-9105-9362a34b9033\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"fa4fd602-fb90-5466-9105-9362a34b9033\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"12033083-b770-5f99-9be0-0a3495fb33a6\" :answer/id #uuid \"12033083-b770-5f99-9be0-0a3495fb33a6\"] [:db/add \"12033083-b770-5f99-9be0-0a3495fb33a6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"12033083-b770-5f99-9be0-0a3495fb33a6\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"12033083-b770-5f99-9be0-0a3495fb33a6\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"8bbc0e95-7b5c-52aa-905d-f8b75261fa33\" :answer/id #uuid \"8bbc0e95-7b5c-52aa-905d-f8b75261fa33\"] [:db/add \"8bbc0e95-7b5c-52aa-905d-f8b75261fa33\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"8bbc0e95-7b5c-52aa-905d-f8b75261fa33\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"8bbc0e95-7b5c-52aa-905d-f8b75261fa33\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"524bda8a-9e74-5c2b-8175-d014bc04c2f0\" :answer/id #uuid \"524bda8a-9e74-5c2b-8175-d014bc04c2f0\"] [:db/add \"524bda8a-9e74-5c2b-8175-d014bc04c2f0\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"524bda8a-9e74-5c2b-8175-d014bc04c2f0\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"524bda8a-9e74-5c2b-8175-d014bc04c2f0\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\"] [:db/add \"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/choices \"5d231189-769b-5732-ace7-6461f3b15312\"] [:db/add \"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/choices \"fa4fd602-fb90-5466-9105-9362a34b9033\"] [:db/add \"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/choices \"12033083-b770-5f99-9be0-0a3495fb33a6\"] [:db/add \"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/choices \"8bbc0e95-7b5c-52aa-905d-f8b75261fa33\"] [:db/add \"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/choices \"524bda8a-9e74-5c2b-8175-d014bc04c2f0\"] [:db/add \"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/correct \"5d231189-769b-5732-ace7-6461f3b15312\"] [:db/ensure \"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"b1eadd6c-be48-5b89-8213-8431b738e7d5\" :question/id #uuid \"b1eadd6c-be48-5b89-8213-8431b738e7d5\"] [:db/add \"b1eadd6c-be48-5b89-8213-8431b738e7d5\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=2 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{3}{4 x^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"b1eadd6c-be48-5b89-8213-8431b738e7d5\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}=\\\\frac{3}{2}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{1}{2}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{3}{4 x^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"b1eadd6c-be48-5b89-8213-8431b738e7d5\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"b1eadd6c-be48-5b89-8213-8431b738e7d5\" :question/answer-fields \"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\"] [:db/ensure \"b1eadd6c-be48-5b89-8213-8431b738e7d5\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"b1eadd6c-be48-5b89-8213-8431b738e7d5\"] [:db/add \"df91b58c-76d6-5221-b4da-81176d963219\" :answer/id #uuid \"df91b58c-76d6-5221-b4da-81176d963219\"] [:db/add \"df91b58c-76d6-5221-b4da-81176d963219\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"df91b58c-76d6-5221-b4da-81176d963219\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"df91b58c-76d6-5221-b4da-81176d963219\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"793eebc9-ff19-55da-9a45-a0a042f0077d\" :answer/id #uuid \"793eebc9-ff19-55da-9a45-a0a042f0077d\"] [:db/add \"793eebc9-ff19-55da-9a45-a0a042f0077d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"793eebc9-ff19-55da-9a45-a0a042f0077d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"793eebc9-ff19-55da-9a45-a0a042f0077d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d0bdfea6-7fe5-5dd6-a448-16d00b993737\" :answer/id #uuid \"d0bdfea6-7fe5-5dd6-a448-16d00b993737\"] [:db/add \"d0bdfea6-7fe5-5dd6-a448-16d00b993737\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d0bdfea6-7fe5-5dd6-a448-16d00b993737\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"d0bdfea6-7fe5-5dd6-a448-16d00b993737\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"bf236200-bd6c-552c-833b-9a7ffabd9453\" :answer/id #uuid \"bf236200-bd6c-552c-833b-9a7ffabd9453\"] [:db/add \"bf236200-bd6c-552c-833b-9a7ffabd9453\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"bf236200-bd6c-552c-833b-9a7ffabd9453\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"bf236200-bd6c-552c-833b-9a7ffabd9453\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"b720c2b4-b3de-5823-aad8-d47e8743d70b\" :answer/id #uuid \"b720c2b4-b3de-5823-aad8-d47e8743d70b\"] [:db/add \"b720c2b4-b3de-5823-aad8-d47e8743d70b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b720c2b4-b3de-5823-aad8-d47e8743d70b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"b720c2b4-b3de-5823-aad8-d47e8743d70b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\"] [:db/add \"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/choices \"df91b58c-76d6-5221-b4da-81176d963219\"] [:db/add \"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/choices \"793eebc9-ff19-55da-9a45-a0a042f0077d\"] [:db/add \"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/choices \"d0bdfea6-7fe5-5dd6-a448-16d00b993737\"] [:db/add \"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/choices \"bf236200-bd6c-552c-833b-9a7ffabd9453\"] [:db/add \"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/choices \"b720c2b4-b3de-5823-aad8-d47e8743d70b\"] [:db/add \"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/correct \"b720c2b4-b3de-5823-aad8-d47e8743d70b\"] [:db/ensure \"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"dcde486a-1e39-59b6-860e-7f24175326c3\" :question/id #uuid \"dcde486a-1e39-59b6-860e-7f24175326c3\"] [:db/add \"dcde486a-1e39-59b6-860e-7f24175326c3\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=3 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{6}} \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 9 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"dcde486a-1e39-59b6-860e-7f24175326c3\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=\\\\frac{4}{3}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{1}{6}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{6}} \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 9 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"dcde486a-1e39-59b6-860e-7f24175326c3\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"dcde486a-1e39-59b6-860e-7f24175326c3\" :question/answer-fields \"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\"] [:db/ensure \"dcde486a-1e39-59b6-860e-7f24175326c3\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"dcde486a-1e39-59b6-860e-7f24175326c3\"] [:db/add \"3e842c11-c7f3-564f-a933-92803d029ea8\" :answer/id #uuid \"3e842c11-c7f3-564f-a933-92803d029ea8\"] [:db/add \"3e842c11-c7f3-564f-a933-92803d029ea8\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"3e842c11-c7f3-564f-a933-92803d029ea8\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"3e842c11-c7f3-564f-a933-92803d029ea8\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"47a44f18-f0ce-55ca-b079-1064dd752f1c\" :answer/id #uuid \"47a44f18-f0ce-55ca-b079-1064dd752f1c\"] [:db/add \"47a44f18-f0ce-55ca-b079-1064dd752f1c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"47a44f18-f0ce-55ca-b079-1064dd752f1c\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"47a44f18-f0ce-55ca-b079-1064dd752f1c\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e7ca9f8b-2271-5493-9c33-abecf2b359aa\" :answer/id #uuid \"e7ca9f8b-2271-5493-9c33-abecf2b359aa\"] [:db/add \"e7ca9f8b-2271-5493-9c33-abecf2b359aa\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e7ca9f8b-2271-5493-9c33-abecf2b359aa\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{6}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"e7ca9f8b-2271-5493-9c33-abecf2b359aa\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"dafbb5d3-917d-5770-b4cd-9a5425b2287f\" :answer/id #uuid \"dafbb5d3-917d-5770-b4cd-9a5425b2287f\"] [:db/add \"dafbb5d3-917d-5770-b4cd-9a5425b2287f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"dafbb5d3-917d-5770-b4cd-9a5425b2287f\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"dafbb5d3-917d-5770-b4cd-9a5425b2287f\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"8f8d094b-7bda-5af9-9605-694b68421bdd\" :answer/id #uuid \"8f8d094b-7bda-5af9-9605-694b68421bdd\"] [:db/add \"8f8d094b-7bda-5af9-9605-694b68421bdd\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"8f8d094b-7bda-5af9-9605-694b68421bdd\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{10}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"8f8d094b-7bda-5af9-9605-694b68421bdd\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\"] [:db/add \"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/choices \"3e842c11-c7f3-564f-a933-92803d029ea8\"] [:db/add \"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/choices \"47a44f18-f0ce-55ca-b079-1064dd752f1c\"] [:db/add \"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/choices \"e7ca9f8b-2271-5493-9c33-abecf2b359aa\"] [:db/add \"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/choices \"dafbb5d3-917d-5770-b4cd-9a5425b2287f\"] [:db/add \"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/choices \"8f8d094b-7bda-5af9-9605-694b68421bdd\"] [:db/add \"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/correct \"47a44f18-f0ce-55ca-b079-1064dd752f1c\"] [:db/ensure \"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"c4504cb1-e783-5667-8405-915d01ad07f7\" :question/id #uuid \"c4504cb1-e783-5667-8405-915d01ad07f7\"] [:db/add \"c4504cb1-e783-5667-8405-915d01ad07f7\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=5 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{5}} \\\\frac{3}{25 x^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"c4504cb1-e783-5667-8405-915d01ad07f7\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{3}{5}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{1}{5}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{5}} \\\\frac{3}{25 x^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"c4504cb1-e783-5667-8405-915d01ad07f7\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"c4504cb1-e783-5667-8405-915d01ad07f7\" :question/answer-fields \"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\"] [:db/ensure \"c4504cb1-e783-5667-8405-915d01ad07f7\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"c4504cb1-e783-5667-8405-915d01ad07f7\"] [:db/add \"821019bb-4994-56a5-8447-9fcd89362852\" :answer/id #uuid \"821019bb-4994-56a5-8447-9fcd89362852\"] [:db/add \"821019bb-4994-56a5-8447-9fcd89362852\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"821019bb-4994-56a5-8447-9fcd89362852\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"821019bb-4994-56a5-8447-9fcd89362852\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"6ec72688-32e4-5656-8061-411a0927fe7e\" :answer/id #uuid \"6ec72688-32e4-5656-8061-411a0927fe7e\"] [:db/add \"6ec72688-32e4-5656-8061-411a0927fe7e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"6ec72688-32e4-5656-8061-411a0927fe7e\" :answer/value \"\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [:db/ensure \"6ec72688-32e4-5656-8061-411a0927fe7e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ab6b489b-2030-5270-bbbd-cd07e0af5b09\" :answer/id #uuid \"ab6b489b-2030-5270-bbbd-cd07e0af5b09\"] [:db/add \"ab6b489b-2030-5270-bbbd-cd07e0af5b09\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ab6b489b-2030-5270-bbbd-cd07e0af5b09\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"ab6b489b-2030-5270-bbbd-cd07e0af5b09\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"cfa3533c-cdd8-5b93-8b50-a2595b657296\" :answer/id #uuid \"cfa3533c-cdd8-5b93-8b50-a2595b657296\"] [:db/add \"cfa3533c-cdd8-5b93-8b50-a2595b657296\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"cfa3533c-cdd8-5b93-8b50-a2595b657296\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"cfa3533c-cdd8-5b93-8b50-a2595b657296\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"727b8260-3d14-5059-9672-3775c19345fa\" :answer/id #uuid \"727b8260-3d14-5059-9672-3775c19345fa\"] [:db/add \"727b8260-3d14-5059-9672-3775c19345fa\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"727b8260-3d14-5059-9672-3775c19345fa\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"727b8260-3d14-5059-9672-3775c19345fa\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\"] [:db/add \"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/choices \"821019bb-4994-56a5-8447-9fcd89362852\"] [:db/add \"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/choices \"6ec72688-32e4-5656-8061-411a0927fe7e\"] [:db/add \"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/choices \"ab6b489b-2030-5270-bbbd-cd07e0af5b09\"] [:db/add \"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/choices \"cfa3533c-cdd8-5b93-8b50-a2595b657296\"] [:db/add \"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/choices \"727b8260-3d14-5059-9672-3775c19345fa\"] [:db/add \"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/correct \"6ec72688-32e4-5656-8061-411a0927fe7e\"] [:db/ensure \"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324\" :question/id #uuid \"31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324\"] [:db/add \"31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=4 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{8}} \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 16 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=1$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{1}{8}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{8}} \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 16 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324\" :question/answer-fields \"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\"] [:db/ensure \"31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324\"] [:db/add \"9bdd67e1-4beb-54d3-b9e9-eeb6ff9c2b12\" :answer/id #uuid \"9bdd67e1-4beb-54d3-b9e9-eeb6ff9c2b12\"] [:db/add \"9bdd67e1-4beb-54d3-b9e9-eeb6ff9c2b12\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"9bdd67e1-4beb-54d3-b9e9-eeb6ff9c2b12\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"9bdd67e1-4beb-54d3-b9e9-eeb6ff9c2b12\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"dff3c3ba-174c-59a9-a7d6-ee62a42838cf\" :answer/id #uuid \"dff3c3ba-174c-59a9-a7d6-ee62a42838cf\"] [:db/add \"dff3c3ba-174c-59a9-a7d6-ee62a42838cf\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"dff3c3ba-174c-59a9-a7d6-ee62a42838cf\" :answer/value \"\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [:db/ensure \"dff3c3ba-174c-59a9-a7d6-ee62a42838cf\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"feb487a8-0c5d-5079-a216-cdadbac5ce2c\" :answer/id #uuid \"feb487a8-0c5d-5079-a216-cdadbac5ce2c\"] [:db/add \"feb487a8-0c5d-5079-a216-cdadbac5ce2c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"feb487a8-0c5d-5079-a216-cdadbac5ce2c\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"feb487a8-0c5d-5079-a216-cdadbac5ce2c\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ffc45760-e969-5f79-a809-324f6b4539a4\" :answer/id #uuid \"ffc45760-e969-5f79-a809-324f6b4539a4\"] [:db/add \"ffc45760-e969-5f79-a809-324f6b4539a4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ffc45760-e969-5f79-a809-324f6b4539a4\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"ffc45760-e969-5f79-a809-324f6b4539a4\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d67390ab-7f56-5eab-9802-08b91490b693\" :answer/id #uuid \"d67390ab-7f56-5eab-9802-08b91490b693\"] [:db/add \"d67390ab-7f56-5eab-9802-08b91490b693\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d67390ab-7f56-5eab-9802-08b91490b693\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"d67390ab-7f56-5eab-9802-08b91490b693\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\"] [:db/add \"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/choices \"9bdd67e1-4beb-54d3-b9e9-eeb6ff9c2b12\"] [:db/add \"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/choices \"dff3c3ba-174c-59a9-a7d6-ee62a42838cf\"] [:db/add \"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/choices \"feb487a8-0c5d-5079-a216-cdadbac5ce2c\"] [:db/add \"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/choices \"ffc45760-e969-5f79-a809-324f6b4539a4\"] [:db/add \"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/choices \"d67390ab-7f56-5eab-9802-08b91490b693\"] [:db/add \"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/correct \"ffc45760-e969-5f79-a809-324f6b4539a4\"] [:db/ensure \"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee\" :question/id #uuid \"8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee\"] [:db/add \"8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=4 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{4}} \\\\frac{2}{16 x^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=\\\\frac{1}{2}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{1}{4}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{4}} \\\\frac{2}{16 x^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee\" :question/answer-fields \"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\"] [:db/ensure \"8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee\"] [:db/add \"21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0\" :answer/id #uuid \"21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0\"] [:db/add \"21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}\"] [:db/ensure \"21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee\"] [:db/add \"c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee\" :answer-field/choices \"21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0\"] [:db/add \"c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee\" :answer-field/correct \"21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0\"] [:db/ensure \"c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a\" :question/id #uuid \"5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a\"] [:db/add \"5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{2} \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{4})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}=4\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{4})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=4\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\\\cdot 4=4$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=2&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{2} \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=4\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}}\\\\right)=4\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a\" :question/answer-fields \"c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee\"] [:db/ensure \"5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a\"] [:db/add \"d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85\" :answer/id #uuid \"d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85\"] [:db/add \"d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\"] [:db/ensure \"d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc\"] [:db/add \"5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc\" :answer-field/choices \"d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85\"] [:db/add \"5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc\" :answer-field/correct \"d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85\"] [:db/ensure \"5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d\" :question/id #uuid \"c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d\"] [:db/add \"c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{4} \\\\frac{4}{x^{2} + 16}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arctan{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\arctan{\\\\left(1 \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{4})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\nx^{2} + 16=16\\\\left(1+(\\\\frac{x}{4})^2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=4\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\cdot 4=1$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=4&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{4} \\\\frac{4}{x^{2} + 16}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{1}=\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d\" :question/answer-fields \"5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc\"] [:db/ensure \"c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d\"] [:db/add \"f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7\" :answer/id #uuid \"f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7\"] [:db/add \"f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\"] [:db/ensure \"f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32\"] [:db/add \"3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32\" :answer-field/choices \"f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7\"] [:db/add \"3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32\" :answer-field/correct \"f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7\"] [:db/ensure \"3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601\" :question/id #uuid \"bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601\"] [:db/add \"bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{3}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{3})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}=3\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{3})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=3\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\cdot 3=1$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{3}{2}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{3}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}}=\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601\" :question/answer-fields \"3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32\"] [:db/ensure \"bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601\"] [:db/add \"752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581\" :answer/id #uuid \"752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581\"] [:db/add \"752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}\"] [:db/ensure \"752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2\"] [:db/add \"f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2\" :answer-field/choices \"752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581\"] [:db/add \"f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2\" :answer-field/correct \"752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581\"] [:db/ensure \"f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575\" :question/id #uuid \"8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575\"] [:db/add \"8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{4} \\\\frac{2}{x^{2} + 16}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arctan{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\arctan{\\\\left(1 \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{4})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\nx^{2} + 16=16\\\\left(1+(\\\\frac{x}{4})^2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=4\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{1}{8}\\\\cdot 4=\\\\frac{1}{2}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=4&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{4} \\\\frac{2}{x^{2} + 16}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{1}\\\\right)=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575\" :question/answer-fields \"f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2\"] [:db/ensure \"8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575\"] [:db/add \"b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52\" :answer/id #uuid \"b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52\"] [:db/add \"b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}\"] [:db/ensure \"b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b\"] [:db/add \"7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b\" :answer-field/choices \"b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52\"] [:db/add \"7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b\" :answer-field/correct \"b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52\"] [:db/ensure \"7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203\" :question/id #uuid \"8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203\"] [:db/add \"8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=2\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\cdot 2=3$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=1&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=3\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}}\\\\right)=3\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203\" :question/answer-fields \"7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b\"] [:db/ensure \"8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203\"] [:db/add \"655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca\" :answer/id #uuid \"655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca\"] [:db/add \"655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\"] [:db/ensure \"655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564\"] [:db/add \"c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564\" :answer-field/choices \"655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca\"] [:db/add \"c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564\" :answer-field/correct \"655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca\"] [:db/ensure \"c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88\" :question/id #uuid \"7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88\"] [:db/add \"7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{2} \\\\frac{2}{x^{2} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arctan{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\arctan{\\\\left(1 \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\nx^{2} + 4=4\\\\left(1+(\\\\frac{x}{2})^2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=2\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\cdot 2=1$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=2&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{2} \\\\frac{2}{x^{2} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{1}=\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88\" :question/answer-fields \"c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564\"] [:db/ensure \"7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88\"] [:db/add \"98984389-6c56-5627-9dcc-17a55eb70207\" :answer/id #uuid \"98984389-6c56-5627-9dcc-17a55eb70207\"] [:db/add \"98984389-6c56-5627-9dcc-17a55eb70207\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"98984389-6c56-5627-9dcc-17a55eb70207\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}\"] [:db/ensure \"98984389-6c56-5627-9dcc-17a55eb70207\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"fc25e429-ec91-5412-b340-a316818fb8a9\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"fc25e429-ec91-5412-b340-a316818fb8a9\"] [:db/add \"fc25e429-ec91-5412-b340-a316818fb8a9\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"fc25e429-ec91-5412-b340-a316818fb8a9\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"fc25e429-ec91-5412-b340-a316818fb8a9\" :answer-field/choices \"98984389-6c56-5627-9dcc-17a55eb70207\"] [:db/add \"fc25e429-ec91-5412-b340-a316818fb8a9\" :answer-field/correct \"98984389-6c56-5627-9dcc-17a55eb70207\"] [:db/ensure \"fc25e429-ec91-5412-b340-a316818fb8a9\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"f3812e4c-4072-5cbb-aae5-d8098598e7d2\" :question/id #uuid \"f3812e4c-4072-5cbb-aae5-d8098598e7d2\"] [:db/add \"f3812e4c-4072-5cbb-aae5-d8098598e7d2\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{3}{2}} \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"f3812e4c-4072-5cbb-aae5-d8098598e7d2\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{3})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}=3\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{3})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=3\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\cdot 3=2$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{3}{2}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{3}{2}} \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}}\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"f3812e4c-4072-5cbb-aae5-d8098598e7d2\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"f3812e4c-4072-5cbb-aae5-d8098598e7d2\" :question/answer-fields \"fc25e429-ec91-5412-b340-a316818fb8a9\"] [:db/ensure \"f3812e4c-4072-5cbb-aae5-d8098598e7d2\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"f3812e4c-4072-5cbb-aae5-d8098598e7d2\"] [:db/add \"a0fc0013-4555-5cdc-9e01-c62bff3e2ff2\" :answer/id #uuid \"a0fc0013-4555-5cdc-9e01-c62bff3e2ff2\"] [:db/add \"a0fc0013-4555-5cdc-9e01-c62bff3e2ff2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"a0fc0013-4555-5cdc-9e01-c62bff3e2ff2\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}\"] [:db/ensure \"a0fc0013-4555-5cdc-9e01-c62bff3e2ff2\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"bdbaa2de-b165-5834-a0ac-d39437261aa1\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"bdbaa2de-b165-5834-a0ac-d39437261aa1\"] [:db/add \"bdbaa2de-b165-5834-a0ac-d39437261aa1\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"bdbaa2de-b165-5834-a0ac-d39437261aa1\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"bdbaa2de-b165-5834-a0ac-d39437261aa1\" :answer-field/choices \"a0fc0013-4555-5cdc-9e01-c62bff3e2ff2\"] [:db/add \"bdbaa2de-b165-5834-a0ac-d39437261aa1\" :answer-field/correct \"a0fc0013-4555-5cdc-9e01-c62bff3e2ff2\"] [:db/ensure \"bdbaa2de-b165-5834-a0ac-d39437261aa1\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"aca9c0da-bf9d-5af9-86af-aa07acdced2e\" :question/id #uuid \"aca9c0da-bf9d-5af9-86af-aa07acdced2e\"] [:db/add \"aca9c0da-bf9d-5af9-86af-aa07acdced2e\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{3} \\\\frac{4}{x^{2} + 9}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arctan{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\arctan{\\\\left(1 \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"aca9c0da-bf9d-5af9-86af-aa07acdced2e\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{3})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\nx^{2} + 9=9\\\\left(1+(\\\\frac{x}{3})^2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=3\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{4}{9}\\\\cdot 3=\\\\frac{4}{3}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=3&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{3} \\\\frac{4}{x^{2} + 9}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{1}\\\\right)=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"aca9c0da-bf9d-5af9-86af-aa07acdced2e\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"aca9c0da-bf9d-5af9-86af-aa07acdced2e\" :question/answer-fields \"bdbaa2de-b165-5834-a0ac-d39437261aa1\"] [:db/ensure \"aca9c0da-bf9d-5af9-86af-aa07acdced2e\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"aca9c0da-bf9d-5af9-86af-aa07acdced2e\"] [:db/add \"19912f7a-c635-5395-99a4-013d98b0d958\" :answer/id #uuid \"19912f7a-c635-5395-99a4-013d98b0d958\"] [:db/add \"19912f7a-c635-5395-99a4-013d98b0d958\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"19912f7a-c635-5395-99a4-013d98b0d958\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}\"] [:db/ensure \"19912f7a-c635-5395-99a4-013d98b0d958\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"be16bb1a-f6f4-5233-8a1c-d8524f048c88\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"be16bb1a-f6f4-5233-8a1c-d8524f048c88\"] [:db/add \"be16bb1a-f6f4-5233-8a1c-d8524f048c88\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"be16bb1a-f6f4-5233-8a1c-d8524f048c88\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"be16bb1a-f6f4-5233-8a1c-d8524f048c88\" :answer-field/choices \"19912f7a-c635-5395-99a4-013d98b0d958\"] [:db/add \"be16bb1a-f6f4-5233-8a1c-d8524f048c88\" :answer-field/correct \"19912f7a-c635-5395-99a4-013d98b0d958\"] [:db/ensure \"be16bb1a-f6f4-5233-8a1c-d8524f048c88\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"3de4a265-dec4-55ca-a9f1-ffb48c66ba45\" :question/id #uuid \"3de4a265-dec4-55ca-a9f1-ffb48c66ba45\"] [:db/add \"3de4a265-dec4-55ca-a9f1-ffb48c66ba45\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{-2}^{2} \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(- \\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6},\\\\quad \\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"3de4a265-dec4-55ca-a9f1-ffb48c66ba45\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{4})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}=4\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{4})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=4\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\cdot 4=2$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=-2&\\\\Longrightarrow u=- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\\\\\x=2&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{-2}^{2} \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int_{- \\\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{- \\\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}}\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"3de4a265-dec4-55ca-a9f1-ffb48c66ba45\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"3de4a265-dec4-55ca-a9f1-ffb48c66ba45\" :question/answer-fields \"be16bb1a-f6f4-5233-8a1c-d8524f048c88\"] [:db/ensure \"3de4a265-dec4-55ca-a9f1-ffb48c66ba45\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"3de4a265-dec4-55ca-a9f1-ffb48c66ba45\"] [:db/add \"f87ba698-cc89-57d9-ac59-41c1cbb4d0ef\" :answer/id #uuid \"f87ba698-cc89-57d9-ac59-41c1cbb4d0ef\"] [:db/add \"f87ba698-cc89-57d9-ac59-41c1cbb4d0ef\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"f87ba698-cc89-57d9-ac59-41c1cbb4d0ef\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}\"] [:db/ensure \"f87ba698-cc89-57d9-ac59-41c1cbb4d0ef\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"745a772a-8ffa-5ea4-98a4-1515869b1c21\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"745a772a-8ffa-5ea4-98a4-1515869b1c21\"] [:db/add \"745a772a-8ffa-5ea4-98a4-1515869b1c21\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"745a772a-8ffa-5ea4-98a4-1515869b1c21\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"745a772a-8ffa-5ea4-98a4-1515869b1c21\" :answer-field/choices \"f87ba698-cc89-57d9-ac59-41c1cbb4d0ef\"] [:db/add \"745a772a-8ffa-5ea4-98a4-1515869b1c21\" :answer-field/correct \"f87ba698-cc89-57d9-ac59-41c1cbb4d0ef\"] [:db/ensure \"745a772a-8ffa-5ea4-98a4-1515869b1c21\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"efb73b4b-4caf-595e-afdb-63f4941357cf\" :question/id #uuid \"efb73b4b-4caf-595e-afdb-63f4941357cf\"] [:db/add \"efb73b4b-4caf-595e-afdb-63f4941357cf\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{-4}^{4} \\\\frac{1}{x^{2} + 16}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arctan{\\\\left(-1 \\\\right)}=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4},\\\\quad \\\\arctan{\\\\left(1 \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"efb73b4b-4caf-595e-afdb-63f4941357cf\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{4})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\nx^{2} + 16=16\\\\left(1+(\\\\frac{x}{4})^2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=4\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{1}{16}\\\\cdot 4=\\\\frac{1}{4}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=-4&\\\\Longrightarrow u=-1\\\\\\\\x=4&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{-4}^{4} \\\\frac{1}{x^{2} + 16}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int_{-1}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{-1}^{1}\\\\right)=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"efb73b4b-4caf-595e-afdb-63f4941357cf\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"efb73b4b-4caf-595e-afdb-63f4941357cf\" :question/answer-fields \"745a772a-8ffa-5ea4-98a4-1515869b1c21\"] [:db/ensure \"efb73b4b-4caf-595e-afdb-63f4941357cf\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"efb73b4b-4caf-595e-afdb-63f4941357cf\"] [:db/add \"cd50c84e-e76e-5b86-9c45-33afb043d39f\" :answer/id #uuid \"cd50c84e-e76e-5b86-9c45-33afb043d39f\"] [:db/add \"cd50c84e-e76e-5b86-9c45-33afb043d39f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"cd50c84e-e76e-5b86-9c45-33afb043d39f\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4 \\\\pi}{3}\"] [:db/ensure \"cd50c84e-e76e-5b86-9c45-33afb043d39f\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"4d7e8cf9-9c61-5b9f-a08a-ea419798d119\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"4d7e8cf9-9c61-5b9f-a08a-ea419798d119\"] [:db/add \"4d7e8cf9-9c61-5b9f-a08a-ea419798d119\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"4d7e8cf9-9c61-5b9f-a08a-ea419798d119\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"4d7e8cf9-9c61-5b9f-a08a-ea419798d119\" :answer-field/choices \"cd50c84e-e76e-5b86-9c45-33afb043d39f\"] [:db/add \"4d7e8cf9-9c61-5b9f-a08a-ea419798d119\" :answer-field/correct \"cd50c84e-e76e-5b86-9c45-33afb043d39f\"] [:db/ensure \"4d7e8cf9-9c61-5b9f-a08a-ea419798d119\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"6dc4c518-ea77-5d68-9ae9-a019b2654d65\" :question/id #uuid \"6dc4c518-ea77-5d68-9ae9-a019b2654d65\"] [:db/add \"6dc4c518-ea77-5d68-9ae9-a019b2654d65\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{- \\\\frac{3}{2}}^{\\\\frac{3}{2}} \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(- \\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6},\\\\quad \\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"6dc4c518-ea77-5d68-9ae9-a019b2654d65\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{3})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}=3\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{3})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=3\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\cdot 3=4$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=- \\\\frac{3}{2}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{3}{2}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{- \\\\frac{3}{2}}^{\\\\frac{3}{2}} \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=4\\\\left(\\\\int_{- \\\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{- \\\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}}\\\\right)=4\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4 \\\\pi}{3}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"6dc4c518-ea77-5d68-9ae9-a019b2654d65\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"6dc4c518-ea77-5d68-9ae9-a019b2654d65\" :question/answer-fields \"4d7e8cf9-9c61-5b9f-a08a-ea419798d119\"] [:db/ensure \"6dc4c518-ea77-5d68-9ae9-a019b2654d65\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"6dc4c518-ea77-5d68-9ae9-a019b2654d65\"] [:db/add \"47cd604e-5003-5beb-a4a5-d9d85cb9390f\" :answer/id #uuid \"47cd604e-5003-5beb-a4a5-d9d85cb9390f\"] [:db/add \"47cd604e-5003-5beb-a4a5-d9d85cb9390f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"47cd604e-5003-5beb-a4a5-d9d85cb9390f\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}\"] [:db/ensure \"47cd604e-5003-5beb-a4a5-d9d85cb9390f\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e94e8786-71eb-5b21-8a20-50168f744c66\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"e94e8786-71eb-5b21-8a20-50168f744c66\"] [:db/add \"e94e8786-71eb-5b21-8a20-50168f744c66\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"e94e8786-71eb-5b21-8a20-50168f744c66\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"e94e8786-71eb-5b21-8a20-50168f744c66\" :answer-field/choices \"47cd604e-5003-5beb-a4a5-d9d85cb9390f\"] [:db/add \"e94e8786-71eb-5b21-8a20-50168f744c66\" :answer-field/correct \"47cd604e-5003-5beb-a4a5-d9d85cb9390f\"] [:db/ensure \"e94e8786-71eb-5b21-8a20-50168f744c66\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"45114a62-33d3-51ec-a7c8-28ce8b3500fa\" :question/id #uuid \"45114a62-33d3-51ec-a7c8-28ce8b3500fa\"] [:db/add \"45114a62-33d3-51ec-a7c8-28ce8b3500fa\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{-3}^{3} \\\\frac{3}{x^{2} + 9}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arctan{\\\\left(-1 \\\\right)}=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4},\\\\quad \\\\arctan{\\\\left(1 \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"45114a62-33d3-51ec-a7c8-28ce8b3500fa\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{3})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\nx^{2} + 9=9\\\\left(1+(\\\\frac{x}{3})^2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=3\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\cdot 3=1$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=-3&\\\\Longrightarrow u=-1\\\\\\\\x=3&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{-3}^{3} \\\\frac{3}{x^{2} + 9}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int_{-1}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{-1}^{1}=\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"45114a62-33d3-51ec-a7c8-28ce8b3500fa\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"45114a62-33d3-51ec-a7c8-28ce8b3500fa\" :question/answer-fields \"e94e8786-71eb-5b21-8a20-50168f744c66\"] [:db/ensure \"45114a62-33d3-51ec-a7c8-28ce8b3500fa\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"45114a62-33d3-51ec-a7c8-28ce8b3500fa\"] [:db/add \"9c9d69e0-30da-568c-aeb8-31c4ee2927ff\" :answer/id #uuid \"9c9d69e0-30da-568c-aeb8-31c4ee2927ff\"] [:db/add \"9c9d69e0-30da-568c-aeb8-31c4ee2927ff\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"9c9d69e0-30da-568c-aeb8-31c4ee2927ff\" :answer/value \"\\\\pi\"] [:db/ensure \"9c9d69e0-30da-568c-aeb8-31c4ee2927ff\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c044c5e2-276b-5b67-8928-84c4a5cfbe6f\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c044c5e2-276b-5b67-8928-84c4a5cfbe6f\"] [:db/add \"c044c5e2-276b-5b67-8928-84c4a5cfbe6f\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"c044c5e2-276b-5b67-8928-84c4a5cfbe6f\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"c044c5e2-276b-5b67-8928-84c4a5cfbe6f\" :answer-field/choices \"9c9d69e0-30da-568c-aeb8-31c4ee2927ff\"] [:db/add \"c044c5e2-276b-5b67-8928-84c4a5cfbe6f\" :answer-field/correct \"9c9d69e0-30da-568c-aeb8-31c4ee2927ff\"] [:db/ensure \"c044c5e2-276b-5b67-8928-84c4a5cfbe6f\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"c4726a49-36ea-5eb2-a7dd-f6af9ac558b8\" :question/id #uuid \"c4726a49-36ea-5eb2-a7dd-f6af9ac558b8\"] [:db/add \"c4726a49-36ea-5eb2-a7dd-f6af9ac558b8\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{-1}^{1} \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(- \\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6},\\\\quad \\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"c4726a49-36ea-5eb2-a7dd-f6af9ac558b8\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=2\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\cdot 2=3$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=-1&\\\\Longrightarrow u=- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\\\\\x=1&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{-1}^{1} \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=3\\\\left(\\\\int_{- \\\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{- \\\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}}\\\\right)=3\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\pi.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"c4726a49-36ea-5eb2-a7dd-f6af9ac558b8\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"c4726a49-36ea-5eb2-a7dd-f6af9ac558b8\" :question/answer-fields \"c044c5e2-276b-5b67-8928-84c4a5cfbe6f\"] [:db/ensure \"c4726a49-36ea-5eb2-a7dd-f6af9ac558b8\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"c4726a49-36ea-5eb2-a7dd-f6af9ac558b8\"] [:db/add \"c91e4652-47f8-5671-81db-f5c918eefb4a\" :answer/id #uuid \"c91e4652-47f8-5671-81db-f5c918eefb4a\"] [:db/add \"c91e4652-47f8-5671-81db-f5c918eefb4a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"c91e4652-47f8-5671-81db-f5c918eefb4a\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{8}\"] [:db/ensure \"c91e4652-47f8-5671-81db-f5c918eefb4a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"0b7619d5-798e-51ec-a379-94d0401eb97d\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"0b7619d5-798e-51ec-a379-94d0401eb97d\"] [:db/add \"0b7619d5-798e-51ec-a379-94d0401eb97d\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"0b7619d5-798e-51ec-a379-94d0401eb97d\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"0b7619d5-798e-51ec-a379-94d0401eb97d\" :answer-field/choices \"c91e4652-47f8-5671-81db-f5c918eefb4a\"] [:db/add \"0b7619d5-798e-51ec-a379-94d0401eb97d\" :answer-field/correct \"c91e4652-47f8-5671-81db-f5c918eefb4a\"] [:db/ensure \"0b7619d5-798e-51ec-a379-94d0401eb97d\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"bc78c8a6-488e-51bf-ac0e-c24a6281e74a\" :question/id #uuid \"bc78c8a6-488e-51bf-ac0e-c24a6281e74a\"] [:db/add \"bc78c8a6-488e-51bf-ac0e-c24a6281e74a\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{-4}^{4} \\\\frac{3}{x^{2} + 16}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arctan{\\\\left(-1 \\\\right)}=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4},\\\\quad \\\\arctan{\\\\left(1 \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"bc78c8a6-488e-51bf-ac0e-c24a6281e74a\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{4})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\nx^{2} + 16=16\\\\left(1+(\\\\frac{x}{4})^2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=4\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{3}{16}\\\\cdot 4=\\\\frac{3}{4}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=-4&\\\\Longrightarrow u=-1\\\\\\\\x=4&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{-4}^{4} \\\\frac{3}{x^{2} + 16}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int_{-1}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{-1}^{1}\\\\right)=\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{8}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"bc78c8a6-488e-51bf-ac0e-c24a6281e74a\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"bc78c8a6-488e-51bf-ac0e-c24a6281e74a\" :question/answer-fields \"0b7619d5-798e-51ec-a379-94d0401eb97d\"] [:db/ensure \"bc78c8a6-488e-51bf-ac0e-c24a6281e74a\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"bc78c8a6-488e-51bf-ac0e-c24a6281e74a\"] [:db/add \"bbc4eb12-c082-533c-91e3-42088827c6c9\" :answer/id #uuid \"bbc4eb12-c082-533c-91e3-42088827c6c9\"] [:db/add \"bbc4eb12-c082-533c-91e3-42088827c6c9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"bbc4eb12-c082-533c-91e3-42088827c6c9\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}\"] [:db/ensure \"bbc4eb12-c082-533c-91e3-42088827c6c9\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"f8ba04b5-b93a-5fbf-9837-f370a0a1420d\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"f8ba04b5-b93a-5fbf-9837-f370a0a1420d\"] [:db/add \"f8ba04b5-b93a-5fbf-9837-f370a0a1420d\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"f8ba04b5-b93a-5fbf-9837-f370a0a1420d\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"f8ba04b5-b93a-5fbf-9837-f370a0a1420d\" :answer-field/choices \"bbc4eb12-c082-533c-91e3-42088827c6c9\"] [:db/add \"f8ba04b5-b93a-5fbf-9837-f370a0a1420d\" :answer-field/correct \"bbc4eb12-c082-533c-91e3-42088827c6c9\"] [:db/ensure \"f8ba04b5-b93a-5fbf-9837-f370a0a1420d\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"98784736-c266-5208-a6fc-c447c86d139a\" :question/id #uuid \"98784736-c266-5208-a6fc-c447c86d139a\"] [:db/add \"98784736-c266-5208-a6fc-c447c86d139a\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{-1}^{1} \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(- \\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6},\\\\quad \\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"98784736-c266-5208-a6fc-c447c86d139a\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=2\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\\\cdot 2=2$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=-1&\\\\Longrightarrow u=- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\\\\\x=1&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{-1}^{1} \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int_{- \\\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{- \\\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}}\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"98784736-c266-5208-a6fc-c447c86d139a\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"98784736-c266-5208-a6fc-c447c86d139a\" :question/answer-fields \"f8ba04b5-b93a-5fbf-9837-f370a0a1420d\"] [:db/ensure \"98784736-c266-5208-a6fc-c447c86d139a\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"98784736-c266-5208-a6fc-c447c86d139a\"] [:db/add \"974f4491-1b3e-5162-8762-b997c2ce7d0a\" :answer/id #uuid \"974f4491-1b3e-5162-8762-b997c2ce7d0a\"] [:db/add \"974f4491-1b3e-5162-8762-b997c2ce7d0a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"974f4491-1b3e-5162-8762-b997c2ce7d0a\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}\"] [:db/ensure \"974f4491-1b3e-5162-8762-b997c2ce7d0a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"7b20481d-efa0-5d19-bace-b463c668fb4a\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"7b20481d-efa0-5d19-bace-b463c668fb4a\"] [:db/add \"7b20481d-efa0-5d19-bace-b463c668fb4a\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"7b20481d-efa0-5d19-bace-b463c668fb4a\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"7b20481d-efa0-5d19-bace-b463c668fb4a\" :answer-field/choices \"974f4491-1b3e-5162-8762-b997c2ce7d0a\"] [:db/add \"7b20481d-efa0-5d19-bace-b463c668fb4a\" :answer-field/correct \"974f4491-1b3e-5162-8762-b997c2ce7d0a\"] [:db/ensure \"7b20481d-efa0-5d19-bace-b463c668fb4a\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"2276b7cb-4dac-5fe2-bb8d-8f1bf4683a99\" :question/id #uuid \"2276b7cb-4dac-5fe2-bb8d-8f1bf4683a99\"] [:db/add \"2276b7cb-4dac-5fe2-bb8d-8f1bf4683a99\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{-2}^{2} \\\\frac{3}{x^{2} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arctan{\\\\left(-1 \\\\right)}=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4},\\\\quad \\\\arctan{\\\\left(1 \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [:db/add \"2276b7cb-4dac-5fe2-bb8d-8f1bf4683a99\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\nx^{2} + 4=4\\\\left(1+(\\\\frac{x}{2})^2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=2\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\cdot 2=\\\\frac{3}{2}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=-2&\\\\Longrightarrow u=-1\\\\\\\\x=2&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{-2}^{2} \\\\frac{3}{x^{2} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{-1}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{-1}^{1}\\\\right)=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"2276b7cb-4dac-5fe2-bb8d-8f1bf4683a99\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"2276b7cb-4dac-5fe2-bb8d-8f1bf4683a99\" :question/answer-fields \"7b20481d-efa0-5d19-bace-b463c668fb4a\"] [:db/ensure \"2276b7cb-4dac-5fe2-bb8d-8f1bf4683a99\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"2276b7cb-4dac-5fe2-bb8d-8f1bf4683a99\"] [:db/add \"generator\" :question-generator/id #uuid \"848d572a-6737-5783-a16b-5584c0ed51f4\"] [:db/add \"generator\" :question-generator/script \"generators/ab/ab2cef1010e703e5af1b7e5dbb70f4af7fd4fbc942eaf2421a84b31b9ddf5f62/generator.py\"] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/question-generator \"generator\"] [:db/ensure 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/validate]] \"assertions\" [[\"fad669bf-e90e-543e-be08-273a10645ddd\" :answer/id #uuid \"fad669bf-e90e-543e-be08-273a10645ddd\"] [\"fad669bf-e90e-543e-be08-273a10645ddd\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"fad669bf-e90e-543e-be08-273a10645ddd\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"fb004aaa-7d4c-5eae-9eb7-e4d0823539b6\" :answer/id #uuid \"fb004aaa-7d4c-5eae-9eb7-e4d0823539b6\"] [\"fb004aaa-7d4c-5eae-9eb7-e4d0823539b6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"fb004aaa-7d4c-5eae-9eb7-e4d0823539b6\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{10}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"9ead6177-d303-5cab-b8ea-a5219cccb094\" :answer/id #uuid \"9ead6177-d303-5cab-b8ea-a5219cccb094\"] [\"9ead6177-d303-5cab-b8ea-a5219cccb094\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"9ead6177-d303-5cab-b8ea-a5219cccb094\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{6}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"6b59afd9-f2c2-5e5e-9970-6f992e37ea86\" :answer/id #uuid \"6b59afd9-f2c2-5e5e-9970-6f992e37ea86\"] [\"6b59afd9-f2c2-5e5e-9970-6f992e37ea86\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"6b59afd9-f2c2-5e5e-9970-6f992e37ea86\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"b1ec166a-a9bc-539d-9701-76c30fbff55b\" :answer/id #uuid \"b1ec166a-a9bc-539d-9701-76c30fbff55b\"] [\"b1ec166a-a9bc-539d-9701-76c30fbff55b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"b1ec166a-a9bc-539d-9701-76c30fbff55b\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\"] [\"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/choices \"fad669bf-e90e-543e-be08-273a10645ddd\"] [\"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/choices \"fb004aaa-7d4c-5eae-9eb7-e4d0823539b6\"] [\"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/choices \"9ead6177-d303-5cab-b8ea-a5219cccb094\"] [\"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/choices \"6b59afd9-f2c2-5e5e-9970-6f992e37ea86\"] [\"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/choices \"b1ec166a-a9bc-539d-9701-76c30fbff55b\"] [\"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\" :answer-field/correct \"fad669bf-e90e-543e-be08-273a10645ddd\"] [\"67653320-5f1a-514c-9009-48894d1fa597\" :question/id #uuid \"67653320-5f1a-514c-9009-48894d1fa597\"] [\"67653320-5f1a-514c-9009-48894d1fa597\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=5 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{10}} \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"67653320-5f1a-514c-9009-48894d1fa597\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{3}{5}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{1}{10}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{10}} \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"67653320-5f1a-514c-9009-48894d1fa597\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"67653320-5f1a-514c-9009-48894d1fa597\" :question/answer-fields \"c10b5724-2833-5916-85d0-8f8b33bab82c\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"67653320-5f1a-514c-9009-48894d1fa597\"] [\"03d5b975-d657-53f4-8d36-078f875960bb\" :answer/id #uuid \"03d5b975-d657-53f4-8d36-078f875960bb\"] [\"03d5b975-d657-53f4-8d36-078f875960bb\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"03d5b975-d657-53f4-8d36-078f875960bb\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"d08db519-79ee-52a5-bffc-d68c86a11848\" :answer/id #uuid \"d08db519-79ee-52a5-bffc-d68c86a11848\"] [\"d08db519-79ee-52a5-bffc-d68c86a11848\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d08db519-79ee-52a5-bffc-d68c86a11848\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"4f1fbc1f-a7b4-5aa0-aab7-92081dbdffa5\" :answer/id #uuid \"4f1fbc1f-a7b4-5aa0-aab7-92081dbdffa5\"] [\"4f1fbc1f-a7b4-5aa0-aab7-92081dbdffa5\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"4f1fbc1f-a7b4-5aa0-aab7-92081dbdffa5\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"fe6e30ab-f88f-59d9-bc5e-71c102d0efd6\" :answer/id #uuid \"fe6e30ab-f88f-59d9-bc5e-71c102d0efd6\"] [\"fe6e30ab-f88f-59d9-bc5e-71c102d0efd6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"fe6e30ab-f88f-59d9-bc5e-71c102d0efd6\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"6d7bdd9f-7915-5cbd-b87c-3174d06d5ecf\" :answer/id #uuid \"6d7bdd9f-7915-5cbd-b87c-3174d06d5ecf\"] [\"6d7bdd9f-7915-5cbd-b87c-3174d06d5ecf\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"6d7bdd9f-7915-5cbd-b87c-3174d06d5ecf\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\"] [\"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/choices \"03d5b975-d657-53f4-8d36-078f875960bb\"] [\"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/choices \"d08db519-79ee-52a5-bffc-d68c86a11848\"] [\"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/choices \"4f1fbc1f-a7b4-5aa0-aab7-92081dbdffa5\"] [\"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/choices \"fe6e30ab-f88f-59d9-bc5e-71c102d0efd6\"] [\"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/choices \"6d7bdd9f-7915-5cbd-b87c-3174d06d5ecf\"] [\"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\" :answer-field/correct \"4f1fbc1f-a7b4-5aa0-aab7-92081dbdffa5\"] [\"ae0341c2-7c53-5699-a7a5-3b8f281ae54b\" :question/id #uuid \"ae0341c2-7c53-5699-a7a5-3b8f281ae54b\"] [\"ae0341c2-7c53-5699-a7a5-3b8f281ae54b\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=3 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{3}} \\\\frac{2}{9 x^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"ae0341c2-7c53-5699-a7a5-3b8f281ae54b\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=\\\\frac{2}{3}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{1}{3}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{3}} \\\\frac{2}{9 x^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"ae0341c2-7c53-5699-a7a5-3b8f281ae54b\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"ae0341c2-7c53-5699-a7a5-3b8f281ae54b\" :question/answer-fields \"9a365cf9-122e-523d-aa85-12038e67c5c1\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"ae0341c2-7c53-5699-a7a5-3b8f281ae54b\"] [\"377d4f69-27e2-54f3-a7e1-e385bb72ca97\" :answer/id #uuid \"377d4f69-27e2-54f3-a7e1-e385bb72ca97\"] [\"377d4f69-27e2-54f3-a7e1-e385bb72ca97\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"377d4f69-27e2-54f3-a7e1-e385bb72ca97\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"5de935b1-d3a2-5a43-a05c-9e9fbcd319db\" :answer/id #uuid \"5de935b1-d3a2-5a43-a05c-9e9fbcd319db\"] [\"5de935b1-d3a2-5a43-a05c-9e9fbcd319db\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"5de935b1-d3a2-5a43-a05c-9e9fbcd319db\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"9340851e-1c58-561c-9176-5e23ee1c80dd\" :answer/id #uuid \"9340851e-1c58-561c-9176-5e23ee1c80dd\"] [\"9340851e-1c58-561c-9176-5e23ee1c80dd\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"9340851e-1c58-561c-9176-5e23ee1c80dd\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"00f269bf-7d07-5172-b58e-2a6c8250fa4e\" :answer/id #uuid \"00f269bf-7d07-5172-b58e-2a6c8250fa4e\"] [\"00f269bf-7d07-5172-b58e-2a6c8250fa4e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"00f269bf-7d07-5172-b58e-2a6c8250fa4e\" :answer/value \"\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [\"ed9fc151-9572-55a9-a4bf-15ee53910c58\" :answer/id #uuid \"ed9fc151-9572-55a9-a4bf-15ee53910c58\"] [\"ed9fc151-9572-55a9-a4bf-15ee53910c58\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"ed9fc151-9572-55a9-a4bf-15ee53910c58\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\"] [\"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/choices \"377d4f69-27e2-54f3-a7e1-e385bb72ca97\"] [\"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/choices \"5de935b1-d3a2-5a43-a05c-9e9fbcd319db\"] [\"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/choices \"9340851e-1c58-561c-9176-5e23ee1c80dd\"] [\"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/choices \"00f269bf-7d07-5172-b58e-2a6c8250fa4e\"] [\"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/choices \"ed9fc151-9572-55a9-a4bf-15ee53910c58\"] [\"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\" :answer-field/correct \"00f269bf-7d07-5172-b58e-2a6c8250fa4e\"] [\"6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646\" :question/id #uuid \"6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646\"] [\"6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=2 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{4}} \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 4 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}=1$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{1}{4}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{4}} \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 4 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [\"6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646\" :question/answer-fields \"c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646\"] [\"5d231189-769b-5732-ace7-6461f3b15312\" :answer/id #uuid \"5d231189-769b-5732-ace7-6461f3b15312\"] [\"5d231189-769b-5732-ace7-6461f3b15312\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"5d231189-769b-5732-ace7-6461f3b15312\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"fa4fd602-fb90-5466-9105-9362a34b9033\" :answer/id #uuid \"fa4fd602-fb90-5466-9105-9362a34b9033\"] [\"fa4fd602-fb90-5466-9105-9362a34b9033\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"fa4fd602-fb90-5466-9105-9362a34b9033\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"12033083-b770-5f99-9be0-0a3495fb33a6\" :answer/id #uuid \"12033083-b770-5f99-9be0-0a3495fb33a6\"] [\"12033083-b770-5f99-9be0-0a3495fb33a6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"12033083-b770-5f99-9be0-0a3495fb33a6\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"8bbc0e95-7b5c-52aa-905d-f8b75261fa33\" :answer/id #uuid \"8bbc0e95-7b5c-52aa-905d-f8b75261fa33\"] [\"8bbc0e95-7b5c-52aa-905d-f8b75261fa33\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"8bbc0e95-7b5c-52aa-905d-f8b75261fa33\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"524bda8a-9e74-5c2b-8175-d014bc04c2f0\" :answer/id #uuid \"524bda8a-9e74-5c2b-8175-d014bc04c2f0\"] [\"524bda8a-9e74-5c2b-8175-d014bc04c2f0\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"524bda8a-9e74-5c2b-8175-d014bc04c2f0\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\"] [\"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/choices \"5d231189-769b-5732-ace7-6461f3b15312\"] [\"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/choices \"fa4fd602-fb90-5466-9105-9362a34b9033\"] [\"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/choices \"12033083-b770-5f99-9be0-0a3495fb33a6\"] [\"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/choices \"8bbc0e95-7b5c-52aa-905d-f8b75261fa33\"] [\"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/choices \"524bda8a-9e74-5c2b-8175-d014bc04c2f0\"] [\"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\" :answer-field/correct \"5d231189-769b-5732-ace7-6461f3b15312\"] [\"b1eadd6c-be48-5b89-8213-8431b738e7d5\" :question/id #uuid \"b1eadd6c-be48-5b89-8213-8431b738e7d5\"] [\"b1eadd6c-be48-5b89-8213-8431b738e7d5\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=2 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{3}{4 x^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"b1eadd6c-be48-5b89-8213-8431b738e7d5\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}=\\\\frac{3}{2}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{1}{2}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{3}{4 x^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"b1eadd6c-be48-5b89-8213-8431b738e7d5\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"b1eadd6c-be48-5b89-8213-8431b738e7d5\" :question/answer-fields \"fd745591-a33f-5a52-85b2-efc8a2030b08\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"b1eadd6c-be48-5b89-8213-8431b738e7d5\"] [\"df91b58c-76d6-5221-b4da-81176d963219\" :answer/id #uuid \"df91b58c-76d6-5221-b4da-81176d963219\"] [\"df91b58c-76d6-5221-b4da-81176d963219\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"df91b58c-76d6-5221-b4da-81176d963219\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"793eebc9-ff19-55da-9a45-a0a042f0077d\" :answer/id #uuid \"793eebc9-ff19-55da-9a45-a0a042f0077d\"] [\"793eebc9-ff19-55da-9a45-a0a042f0077d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"793eebc9-ff19-55da-9a45-a0a042f0077d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"d0bdfea6-7fe5-5dd6-a448-16d00b993737\" :answer/id #uuid \"d0bdfea6-7fe5-5dd6-a448-16d00b993737\"] [\"d0bdfea6-7fe5-5dd6-a448-16d00b993737\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d0bdfea6-7fe5-5dd6-a448-16d00b993737\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"bf236200-bd6c-552c-833b-9a7ffabd9453\" :answer/id #uuid \"bf236200-bd6c-552c-833b-9a7ffabd9453\"] [\"bf236200-bd6c-552c-833b-9a7ffabd9453\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"bf236200-bd6c-552c-833b-9a7ffabd9453\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"b720c2b4-b3de-5823-aad8-d47e8743d70b\" :answer/id #uuid \"b720c2b4-b3de-5823-aad8-d47e8743d70b\"] [\"b720c2b4-b3de-5823-aad8-d47e8743d70b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"b720c2b4-b3de-5823-aad8-d47e8743d70b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\"] [\"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/choices \"df91b58c-76d6-5221-b4da-81176d963219\"] [\"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/choices \"793eebc9-ff19-55da-9a45-a0a042f0077d\"] [\"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/choices \"d0bdfea6-7fe5-5dd6-a448-16d00b993737\"] [\"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/choices \"bf236200-bd6c-552c-833b-9a7ffabd9453\"] [\"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/choices \"b720c2b4-b3de-5823-aad8-d47e8743d70b\"] [\"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\" :answer-field/correct \"b720c2b4-b3de-5823-aad8-d47e8743d70b\"] [\"dcde486a-1e39-59b6-860e-7f24175326c3\" :question/id #uuid \"dcde486a-1e39-59b6-860e-7f24175326c3\"] [\"dcde486a-1e39-59b6-860e-7f24175326c3\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=3 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{6}} \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 9 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"dcde486a-1e39-59b6-860e-7f24175326c3\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=\\\\frac{4}{3}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{1}{6}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{6}} \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 9 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"dcde486a-1e39-59b6-860e-7f24175326c3\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"dcde486a-1e39-59b6-860e-7f24175326c3\" :question/answer-fields \"417f0d82-5629-5869-bb12-64ec6d069d15\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"dcde486a-1e39-59b6-860e-7f24175326c3\"] [\"3e842c11-c7f3-564f-a933-92803d029ea8\" :answer/id #uuid \"3e842c11-c7f3-564f-a933-92803d029ea8\"] [\"3e842c11-c7f3-564f-a933-92803d029ea8\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"3e842c11-c7f3-564f-a933-92803d029ea8\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"47a44f18-f0ce-55ca-b079-1064dd752f1c\" :answer/id #uuid \"47a44f18-f0ce-55ca-b079-1064dd752f1c\"] [\"47a44f18-f0ce-55ca-b079-1064dd752f1c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"47a44f18-f0ce-55ca-b079-1064dd752f1c\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"e7ca9f8b-2271-5493-9c33-abecf2b359aa\" :answer/id #uuid \"e7ca9f8b-2271-5493-9c33-abecf2b359aa\"] [\"e7ca9f8b-2271-5493-9c33-abecf2b359aa\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"e7ca9f8b-2271-5493-9c33-abecf2b359aa\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{6}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"dafbb5d3-917d-5770-b4cd-9a5425b2287f\" :answer/id #uuid \"dafbb5d3-917d-5770-b4cd-9a5425b2287f\"] [\"dafbb5d3-917d-5770-b4cd-9a5425b2287f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"dafbb5d3-917d-5770-b4cd-9a5425b2287f\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"8f8d094b-7bda-5af9-9605-694b68421bdd\" :answer/id #uuid \"8f8d094b-7bda-5af9-9605-694b68421bdd\"] [\"8f8d094b-7bda-5af9-9605-694b68421bdd\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"8f8d094b-7bda-5af9-9605-694b68421bdd\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{10}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\"] [\"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/choices \"3e842c11-c7f3-564f-a933-92803d029ea8\"] [\"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/choices \"47a44f18-f0ce-55ca-b079-1064dd752f1c\"] [\"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/choices \"e7ca9f8b-2271-5493-9c33-abecf2b359aa\"] [\"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/choices \"dafbb5d3-917d-5770-b4cd-9a5425b2287f\"] [\"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/choices \"8f8d094b-7bda-5af9-9605-694b68421bdd\"] [\"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\" :answer-field/correct \"47a44f18-f0ce-55ca-b079-1064dd752f1c\"] [\"c4504cb1-e783-5667-8405-915d01ad07f7\" :question/id #uuid \"c4504cb1-e783-5667-8405-915d01ad07f7\"] [\"c4504cb1-e783-5667-8405-915d01ad07f7\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=5 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{5}} \\\\frac{3}{25 x^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"c4504cb1-e783-5667-8405-915d01ad07f7\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{3}{5}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{1}{5}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{5}} \\\\frac{3}{25 x^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"c4504cb1-e783-5667-8405-915d01ad07f7\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"c4504cb1-e783-5667-8405-915d01ad07f7\" :question/answer-fields \"01f6e205-54d3-50aa-9865-a5450b0e94bf\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"c4504cb1-e783-5667-8405-915d01ad07f7\"] [\"821019bb-4994-56a5-8447-9fcd89362852\" :answer/id #uuid \"821019bb-4994-56a5-8447-9fcd89362852\"] [\"821019bb-4994-56a5-8447-9fcd89362852\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"821019bb-4994-56a5-8447-9fcd89362852\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"6ec72688-32e4-5656-8061-411a0927fe7e\" :answer/id #uuid \"6ec72688-32e4-5656-8061-411a0927fe7e\"] [\"6ec72688-32e4-5656-8061-411a0927fe7e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"6ec72688-32e4-5656-8061-411a0927fe7e\" :answer/value \"\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [\"ab6b489b-2030-5270-bbbd-cd07e0af5b09\" :answer/id #uuid \"ab6b489b-2030-5270-bbbd-cd07e0af5b09\"] [\"ab6b489b-2030-5270-bbbd-cd07e0af5b09\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"ab6b489b-2030-5270-bbbd-cd07e0af5b09\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"cfa3533c-cdd8-5b93-8b50-a2595b657296\" :answer/id #uuid \"cfa3533c-cdd8-5b93-8b50-a2595b657296\"] [\"cfa3533c-cdd8-5b93-8b50-a2595b657296\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"cfa3533c-cdd8-5b93-8b50-a2595b657296\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"727b8260-3d14-5059-9672-3775c19345fa\" :answer/id #uuid \"727b8260-3d14-5059-9672-3775c19345fa\"] [\"727b8260-3d14-5059-9672-3775c19345fa\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"727b8260-3d14-5059-9672-3775c19345fa\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\"] [\"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/choices \"821019bb-4994-56a5-8447-9fcd89362852\"] [\"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/choices \"6ec72688-32e4-5656-8061-411a0927fe7e\"] [\"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/choices \"ab6b489b-2030-5270-bbbd-cd07e0af5b09\"] [\"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/choices \"cfa3533c-cdd8-5b93-8b50-a2595b657296\"] [\"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/choices \"727b8260-3d14-5059-9672-3775c19345fa\"] [\"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\" :answer-field/correct \"6ec72688-32e4-5656-8061-411a0927fe7e\"] [\"31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324\" :question/id #uuid \"31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324\"] [\"31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=4 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{8}} \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 16 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=1$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{1}{8}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{8}} \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 16 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [\"31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324\" :question/answer-fields \"455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324\"] [\"9bdd67e1-4beb-54d3-b9e9-eeb6ff9c2b12\" :answer/id #uuid \"9bdd67e1-4beb-54d3-b9e9-eeb6ff9c2b12\"] [\"9bdd67e1-4beb-54d3-b9e9-eeb6ff9c2b12\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"9bdd67e1-4beb-54d3-b9e9-eeb6ff9c2b12\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"dff3c3ba-174c-59a9-a7d6-ee62a42838cf\" :answer/id #uuid \"dff3c3ba-174c-59a9-a7d6-ee62a42838cf\"] [\"dff3c3ba-174c-59a9-a7d6-ee62a42838cf\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"dff3c3ba-174c-59a9-a7d6-ee62a42838cf\" :answer/value \"\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [\"feb487a8-0c5d-5079-a216-cdadbac5ce2c\" :answer/id #uuid \"feb487a8-0c5d-5079-a216-cdadbac5ce2c\"] [\"feb487a8-0c5d-5079-a216-cdadbac5ce2c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"feb487a8-0c5d-5079-a216-cdadbac5ce2c\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"ffc45760-e969-5f79-a809-324f6b4539a4\" :answer/id #uuid \"ffc45760-e969-5f79-a809-324f6b4539a4\"] [\"ffc45760-e969-5f79-a809-324f6b4539a4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"ffc45760-e969-5f79-a809-324f6b4539a4\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"d67390ab-7f56-5eab-9802-08b91490b693\" :answer/id #uuid \"d67390ab-7f56-5eab-9802-08b91490b693\"] [\"d67390ab-7f56-5eab-9802-08b91490b693\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d67390ab-7f56-5eab-9802-08b91490b693\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\"] [\"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/choices \"9bdd67e1-4beb-54d3-b9e9-eeb6ff9c2b12\"] [\"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/choices \"dff3c3ba-174c-59a9-a7d6-ee62a42838cf\"] [\"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/choices \"feb487a8-0c5d-5079-a216-cdadbac5ce2c\"] [\"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/choices \"ffc45760-e969-5f79-a809-324f6b4539a4\"] [\"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/choices \"d67390ab-7f56-5eab-9802-08b91490b693\"] [\"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\" :answer-field/correct \"ffc45760-e969-5f79-a809-324f6b4539a4\"] [\"8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee\" :question/id #uuid \"8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee\"] [\"8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=4 x$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{4}} \\\\frac{2}{16 x^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=\\\\frac{1}{2}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{1}{4}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{4}} \\\\frac{2}{16 x^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee\" :question/answer-fields \"dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee\"] [\"21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0\" :answer/id #uuid \"21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0\"] [\"21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}\"] [\"c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee\"] [\"c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee\" :answer-field/choices \"21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0\"] [\"c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee\" :answer-field/correct \"21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0\"] [\"5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a\" :question/id #uuid \"5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a\"] [\"5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{2} \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{4})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}=4\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{4})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=4\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\\\cdot 4=4$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=2&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{2} \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=4\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}}\\\\right)=4\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}.\\n$$\"] [\"5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a\" :question/answer-fields \"c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a\"] [\"d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85\" :answer/id #uuid \"d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85\"] [\"d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\"] [\"5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc\"] [\"5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc\" :answer-field/choices \"d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85\"] [\"5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc\" :answer-field/correct \"d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85\"] [\"c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d\" :question/id #uuid \"c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d\"] [\"c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{4} \\\\frac{4}{x^{2} + 16}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arctan{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\arctan{\\\\left(1 \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{4})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\nx^{2} + 16=16\\\\left(1+(\\\\frac{x}{4})^2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=4\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\cdot 4=1$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=4&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{4} \\\\frac{4}{x^{2} + 16}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{1}=\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}.\\n$$\"] [\"c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d\" :question/answer-fields \"5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d\"] [\"f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7\" :answer/id #uuid \"f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7\"] [\"f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\"] [\"3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32\"] [\"3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32\" :answer-field/choices \"f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7\"] [\"3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32\" :answer-field/correct \"f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7\"] [\"bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601\" :question/id #uuid \"bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601\"] [\"bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{3}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{3})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}=3\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{3})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=3\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\cdot 3=1$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{3}{2}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{3}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}}=\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}.\\n$$\"] [\"bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601\" :question/answer-fields \"3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601\"] [\"752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581\" :answer/id #uuid \"752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581\"] [\"752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}\"] [\"f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2\"] [\"f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2\" :answer-field/choices \"752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581\"] [\"f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2\" :answer-field/correct \"752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581\"] [\"8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575\" :question/id #uuid \"8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575\"] [\"8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{4} \\\\frac{2}{x^{2} + 16}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arctan{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\arctan{\\\\left(1 \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{4})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\nx^{2} + 16=16\\\\left(1+(\\\\frac{x}{4})^2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=4\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{1}{8}\\\\cdot 4=\\\\frac{1}{2}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=4&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{4} \\\\frac{2}{x^{2} + 16}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{1}\\\\right)=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}.\\n$$\"] [\"8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575\" :question/answer-fields \"f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575\"] [\"b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52\" :answer/id #uuid \"b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52\"] [\"b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}\"] [\"7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b\"] [\"7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b\" :answer-field/choices \"b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52\"] [\"7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b\" :answer-field/correct \"b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52\"] [\"8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203\" :question/id #uuid \"8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203\"] [\"8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=2\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\cdot 2=3$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=1&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=3\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}}\\\\right)=3\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}.\\n$$\"] [\"8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203\" :question/answer-fields \"7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203\"] [\"655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca\" :answer/id #uuid \"655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca\"] [\"655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\"] [\"c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564\"] [\"c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564\" :answer-field/choices \"655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca\"] [\"c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564\" :answer-field/correct \"655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca\"] [\"7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88\" :question/id #uuid \"7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88\"] [\"7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{2} \\\\frac{2}{x^{2} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arctan{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\arctan{\\\\left(1 \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\nx^{2} + 4=4\\\\left(1+(\\\\frac{x}{2})^2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=2\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\cdot 2=1$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=2&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{2} \\\\frac{2}{x^{2} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{1}=\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}.\\n$$\"] [\"7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88\" :question/answer-fields \"c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88\"] [\"98984389-6c56-5627-9dcc-17a55eb70207\" :answer/id #uuid \"98984389-6c56-5627-9dcc-17a55eb70207\"] [\"98984389-6c56-5627-9dcc-17a55eb70207\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"98984389-6c56-5627-9dcc-17a55eb70207\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}\"] [\"fc25e429-ec91-5412-b340-a316818fb8a9\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"fc25e429-ec91-5412-b340-a316818fb8a9\"] [\"fc25e429-ec91-5412-b340-a316818fb8a9\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"fc25e429-ec91-5412-b340-a316818fb8a9\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"fc25e429-ec91-5412-b340-a316818fb8a9\" :answer-field/choices \"98984389-6c56-5627-9dcc-17a55eb70207\"] [\"fc25e429-ec91-5412-b340-a316818fb8a9\" :answer-field/correct \"98984389-6c56-5627-9dcc-17a55eb70207\"] [\"f3812e4c-4072-5cbb-aae5-d8098598e7d2\" :question/id #uuid \"f3812e4c-4072-5cbb-aae5-d8098598e7d2\"] [\"f3812e4c-4072-5cbb-aae5-d8098598e7d2\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{3}{2}} \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"f3812e4c-4072-5cbb-aae5-d8098598e7d2\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{3})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}=3\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{3})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=3\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\cdot 3=2$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{3}{2}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{3}{2}} \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}}\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}.\\n$$\"] [\"f3812e4c-4072-5cbb-aae5-d8098598e7d2\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"f3812e4c-4072-5cbb-aae5-d8098598e7d2\" :question/answer-fields \"fc25e429-ec91-5412-b340-a316818fb8a9\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"f3812e4c-4072-5cbb-aae5-d8098598e7d2\"] [\"a0fc0013-4555-5cdc-9e01-c62bff3e2ff2\" :answer/id #uuid \"a0fc0013-4555-5cdc-9e01-c62bff3e2ff2\"] [\"a0fc0013-4555-5cdc-9e01-c62bff3e2ff2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"a0fc0013-4555-5cdc-9e01-c62bff3e2ff2\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}\"] [\"bdbaa2de-b165-5834-a0ac-d39437261aa1\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"bdbaa2de-b165-5834-a0ac-d39437261aa1\"] [\"bdbaa2de-b165-5834-a0ac-d39437261aa1\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"bdbaa2de-b165-5834-a0ac-d39437261aa1\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"bdbaa2de-b165-5834-a0ac-d39437261aa1\" :answer-field/choices \"a0fc0013-4555-5cdc-9e01-c62bff3e2ff2\"] [\"bdbaa2de-b165-5834-a0ac-d39437261aa1\" :answer-field/correct \"a0fc0013-4555-5cdc-9e01-c62bff3e2ff2\"] [\"aca9c0da-bf9d-5af9-86af-aa07acdced2e\" :question/id #uuid \"aca9c0da-bf9d-5af9-86af-aa07acdced2e\"] [\"aca9c0da-bf9d-5af9-86af-aa07acdced2e\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{0}^{3} \\\\frac{4}{x^{2} + 9}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arctan{\\\\left(0 \\\\right)}=0,\\\\quad \\\\arctan{\\\\left(1 \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"aca9c0da-bf9d-5af9-86af-aa07acdced2e\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{3})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\nx^{2} + 9=9\\\\left(1+(\\\\frac{x}{3})^2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=3\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{4}{9}\\\\cdot 3=\\\\frac{4}{3}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\\\\\x=3&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{0}^{3} \\\\frac{4}{x^{2} + 9}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int_{0}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{0}^{1}\\\\right)=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)-\\\\left(0\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}.\\n$$\"] [\"aca9c0da-bf9d-5af9-86af-aa07acdced2e\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"aca9c0da-bf9d-5af9-86af-aa07acdced2e\" :question/answer-fields \"bdbaa2de-b165-5834-a0ac-d39437261aa1\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"aca9c0da-bf9d-5af9-86af-aa07acdced2e\"] [\"19912f7a-c635-5395-99a4-013d98b0d958\" :answer/id #uuid \"19912f7a-c635-5395-99a4-013d98b0d958\"] [\"19912f7a-c635-5395-99a4-013d98b0d958\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"19912f7a-c635-5395-99a4-013d98b0d958\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}\"] [\"be16bb1a-f6f4-5233-8a1c-d8524f048c88\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"be16bb1a-f6f4-5233-8a1c-d8524f048c88\"] [\"be16bb1a-f6f4-5233-8a1c-d8524f048c88\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"be16bb1a-f6f4-5233-8a1c-d8524f048c88\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"be16bb1a-f6f4-5233-8a1c-d8524f048c88\" :answer-field/choices \"19912f7a-c635-5395-99a4-013d98b0d958\"] [\"be16bb1a-f6f4-5233-8a1c-d8524f048c88\" :answer-field/correct \"19912f7a-c635-5395-99a4-013d98b0d958\"] [\"3de4a265-dec4-55ca-a9f1-ffb48c66ba45\" :question/id #uuid \"3de4a265-dec4-55ca-a9f1-ffb48c66ba45\"] [\"3de4a265-dec4-55ca-a9f1-ffb48c66ba45\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{-2}^{2} \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(- \\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6},\\\\quad \\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"3de4a265-dec4-55ca-a9f1-ffb48c66ba45\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{4})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}=4\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{4})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=4\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\cdot 4=2$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=-2&\\\\Longrightarrow u=- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\\\\\x=2&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{-2}^{2} \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int_{- \\\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{- \\\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}}\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}.\\n$$\"] [\"3de4a265-dec4-55ca-a9f1-ffb48c66ba45\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"3de4a265-dec4-55ca-a9f1-ffb48c66ba45\" :question/answer-fields \"be16bb1a-f6f4-5233-8a1c-d8524f048c88\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"3de4a265-dec4-55ca-a9f1-ffb48c66ba45\"] [\"f87ba698-cc89-57d9-ac59-41c1cbb4d0ef\" :answer/id #uuid \"f87ba698-cc89-57d9-ac59-41c1cbb4d0ef\"] [\"f87ba698-cc89-57d9-ac59-41c1cbb4d0ef\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"f87ba698-cc89-57d9-ac59-41c1cbb4d0ef\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}\"] [\"745a772a-8ffa-5ea4-98a4-1515869b1c21\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"745a772a-8ffa-5ea4-98a4-1515869b1c21\"] [\"745a772a-8ffa-5ea4-98a4-1515869b1c21\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"745a772a-8ffa-5ea4-98a4-1515869b1c21\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"745a772a-8ffa-5ea4-98a4-1515869b1c21\" :answer-field/choices \"f87ba698-cc89-57d9-ac59-41c1cbb4d0ef\"] [\"745a772a-8ffa-5ea4-98a4-1515869b1c21\" :answer-field/correct \"f87ba698-cc89-57d9-ac59-41c1cbb4d0ef\"] [\"efb73b4b-4caf-595e-afdb-63f4941357cf\" :question/id #uuid \"efb73b4b-4caf-595e-afdb-63f4941357cf\"] [\"efb73b4b-4caf-595e-afdb-63f4941357cf\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{-4}^{4} \\\\frac{1}{x^{2} + 16}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arctan{\\\\left(-1 \\\\right)}=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4},\\\\quad \\\\arctan{\\\\left(1 \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"efb73b4b-4caf-595e-afdb-63f4941357cf\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{4})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\nx^{2} + 16=16\\\\left(1+(\\\\frac{x}{4})^2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=4\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{1}{16}\\\\cdot 4=\\\\frac{1}{4}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=-4&\\\\Longrightarrow u=-1\\\\\\\\x=4&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{-4}^{4} \\\\frac{1}{x^{2} + 16}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int_{-1}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{-1}^{1}\\\\right)=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{8}.\\n$$\"] [\"efb73b4b-4caf-595e-afdb-63f4941357cf\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"efb73b4b-4caf-595e-afdb-63f4941357cf\" :question/answer-fields \"745a772a-8ffa-5ea4-98a4-1515869b1c21\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"efb73b4b-4caf-595e-afdb-63f4941357cf\"] [\"cd50c84e-e76e-5b86-9c45-33afb043d39f\" :answer/id #uuid \"cd50c84e-e76e-5b86-9c45-33afb043d39f\"] [\"cd50c84e-e76e-5b86-9c45-33afb043d39f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"cd50c84e-e76e-5b86-9c45-33afb043d39f\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4 \\\\pi}{3}\"] [\"4d7e8cf9-9c61-5b9f-a08a-ea419798d119\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"4d7e8cf9-9c61-5b9f-a08a-ea419798d119\"] [\"4d7e8cf9-9c61-5b9f-a08a-ea419798d119\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"4d7e8cf9-9c61-5b9f-a08a-ea419798d119\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"4d7e8cf9-9c61-5b9f-a08a-ea419798d119\" :answer-field/choices \"cd50c84e-e76e-5b86-9c45-33afb043d39f\"] [\"4d7e8cf9-9c61-5b9f-a08a-ea419798d119\" :answer-field/correct \"cd50c84e-e76e-5b86-9c45-33afb043d39f\"] [\"6dc4c518-ea77-5d68-9ae9-a019b2654d65\" :question/id #uuid \"6dc4c518-ea77-5d68-9ae9-a019b2654d65\"] [\"6dc4c518-ea77-5d68-9ae9-a019b2654d65\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{- \\\\frac{3}{2}}^{\\\\frac{3}{2}} \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(- \\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6},\\\\quad \\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"6dc4c518-ea77-5d68-9ae9-a019b2654d65\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{3})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}=3\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{3})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=3\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\cdot 3=4$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=- \\\\frac{3}{2}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\\\\\x=\\\\frac{3}{2}&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{- \\\\frac{3}{2}}^{\\\\frac{3}{2}} \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=4\\\\left(\\\\int_{- \\\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{- \\\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}}\\\\right)=4\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4 \\\\pi}{3}.\\n$$\"] [\"6dc4c518-ea77-5d68-9ae9-a019b2654d65\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"6dc4c518-ea77-5d68-9ae9-a019b2654d65\" :question/answer-fields \"4d7e8cf9-9c61-5b9f-a08a-ea419798d119\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"6dc4c518-ea77-5d68-9ae9-a019b2654d65\"] [\"47cd604e-5003-5beb-a4a5-d9d85cb9390f\" :answer/id #uuid \"47cd604e-5003-5beb-a4a5-d9d85cb9390f\"] [\"47cd604e-5003-5beb-a4a5-d9d85cb9390f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"47cd604e-5003-5beb-a4a5-d9d85cb9390f\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}\"] [\"e94e8786-71eb-5b21-8a20-50168f744c66\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"e94e8786-71eb-5b21-8a20-50168f744c66\"] [\"e94e8786-71eb-5b21-8a20-50168f744c66\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"e94e8786-71eb-5b21-8a20-50168f744c66\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"e94e8786-71eb-5b21-8a20-50168f744c66\" :answer-field/choices \"47cd604e-5003-5beb-a4a5-d9d85cb9390f\"] [\"e94e8786-71eb-5b21-8a20-50168f744c66\" :answer-field/correct \"47cd604e-5003-5beb-a4a5-d9d85cb9390f\"] [\"45114a62-33d3-51ec-a7c8-28ce8b3500fa\" :question/id #uuid \"45114a62-33d3-51ec-a7c8-28ce8b3500fa\"] [\"45114a62-33d3-51ec-a7c8-28ce8b3500fa\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{-3}^{3} \\\\frac{3}{x^{2} + 9}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arctan{\\\\left(-1 \\\\right)}=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4},\\\\quad \\\\arctan{\\\\left(1 \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"45114a62-33d3-51ec-a7c8-28ce8b3500fa\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{3})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\nx^{2} + 9=9\\\\left(1+(\\\\frac{x}{3})^2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=3\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\cdot 3=1$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=-3&\\\\Longrightarrow u=-1\\\\\\\\x=3&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{-3}^{3} \\\\frac{3}{x^{2} + 9}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int_{-1}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\left[\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{-1}^{1}=\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}.\\n$$\"] [\"45114a62-33d3-51ec-a7c8-28ce8b3500fa\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"45114a62-33d3-51ec-a7c8-28ce8b3500fa\" :question/answer-fields \"e94e8786-71eb-5b21-8a20-50168f744c66\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"45114a62-33d3-51ec-a7c8-28ce8b3500fa\"] [\"9c9d69e0-30da-568c-aeb8-31c4ee2927ff\" :answer/id #uuid \"9c9d69e0-30da-568c-aeb8-31c4ee2927ff\"] [\"9c9d69e0-30da-568c-aeb8-31c4ee2927ff\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"9c9d69e0-30da-568c-aeb8-31c4ee2927ff\" :answer/value \"\\\\pi\"] [\"c044c5e2-276b-5b67-8928-84c4a5cfbe6f\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"c044c5e2-276b-5b67-8928-84c4a5cfbe6f\"] [\"c044c5e2-276b-5b67-8928-84c4a5cfbe6f\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"c044c5e2-276b-5b67-8928-84c4a5cfbe6f\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"c044c5e2-276b-5b67-8928-84c4a5cfbe6f\" :answer-field/choices \"9c9d69e0-30da-568c-aeb8-31c4ee2927ff\"] [\"c044c5e2-276b-5b67-8928-84c4a5cfbe6f\" :answer-field/correct \"9c9d69e0-30da-568c-aeb8-31c4ee2927ff\"] [\"c4726a49-36ea-5eb2-a7dd-f6af9ac558b8\" :question/id #uuid \"c4726a49-36ea-5eb2-a7dd-f6af9ac558b8\"] [\"c4726a49-36ea-5eb2-a7dd-f6af9ac558b8\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{-1}^{1} \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(- \\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6},\\\\quad \\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"c4726a49-36ea-5eb2-a7dd-f6af9ac558b8\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=2\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\cdot 2=3$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=-1&\\\\Longrightarrow u=- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\\\\\x=1&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{-1}^{1} \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=3\\\\left(\\\\int_{- \\\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{- \\\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}}\\\\right)=3\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\pi.\\n$$\"] [\"c4726a49-36ea-5eb2-a7dd-f6af9ac558b8\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"c4726a49-36ea-5eb2-a7dd-f6af9ac558b8\" :question/answer-fields \"c044c5e2-276b-5b67-8928-84c4a5cfbe6f\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"c4726a49-36ea-5eb2-a7dd-f6af9ac558b8\"] [\"c91e4652-47f8-5671-81db-f5c918eefb4a\" :answer/id #uuid \"c91e4652-47f8-5671-81db-f5c918eefb4a\"] [\"c91e4652-47f8-5671-81db-f5c918eefb4a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"c91e4652-47f8-5671-81db-f5c918eefb4a\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{8}\"] [\"0b7619d5-798e-51ec-a379-94d0401eb97d\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"0b7619d5-798e-51ec-a379-94d0401eb97d\"] [\"0b7619d5-798e-51ec-a379-94d0401eb97d\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"0b7619d5-798e-51ec-a379-94d0401eb97d\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"0b7619d5-798e-51ec-a379-94d0401eb97d\" :answer-field/choices \"c91e4652-47f8-5671-81db-f5c918eefb4a\"] [\"0b7619d5-798e-51ec-a379-94d0401eb97d\" :answer-field/correct \"c91e4652-47f8-5671-81db-f5c918eefb4a\"] [\"bc78c8a6-488e-51bf-ac0e-c24a6281e74a\" :question/id #uuid \"bc78c8a6-488e-51bf-ac0e-c24a6281e74a\"] [\"bc78c8a6-488e-51bf-ac0e-c24a6281e74a\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{-4}^{4} \\\\frac{3}{x^{2} + 16}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arctan{\\\\left(-1 \\\\right)}=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4},\\\\quad \\\\arctan{\\\\left(1 \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"bc78c8a6-488e-51bf-ac0e-c24a6281e74a\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{4})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\nx^{2} + 16=16\\\\left(1+(\\\\frac{x}{4})^2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=4\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{3}{16}\\\\cdot 4=\\\\frac{3}{4}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=-4&\\\\Longrightarrow u=-1\\\\\\\\x=4&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{-4}^{4} \\\\frac{3}{x^{2} + 16}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int_{-1}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{-1}^{1}\\\\right)=\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{8}.\\n$$\"] [\"bc78c8a6-488e-51bf-ac0e-c24a6281e74a\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"bc78c8a6-488e-51bf-ac0e-c24a6281e74a\" :question/answer-fields \"0b7619d5-798e-51ec-a379-94d0401eb97d\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"bc78c8a6-488e-51bf-ac0e-c24a6281e74a\"] [\"bbc4eb12-c082-533c-91e3-42088827c6c9\" :answer/id #uuid \"bbc4eb12-c082-533c-91e3-42088827c6c9\"] [\"bbc4eb12-c082-533c-91e3-42088827c6c9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"bbc4eb12-c082-533c-91e3-42088827c6c9\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}\"] [\"f8ba04b5-b93a-5fbf-9837-f370a0a1420d\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"f8ba04b5-b93a-5fbf-9837-f370a0a1420d\"] [\"f8ba04b5-b93a-5fbf-9837-f370a0a1420d\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"f8ba04b5-b93a-5fbf-9837-f370a0a1420d\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"f8ba04b5-b93a-5fbf-9837-f370a0a1420d\" :answer-field/choices \"bbc4eb12-c082-533c-91e3-42088827c6c9\"] [\"f8ba04b5-b93a-5fbf-9837-f370a0a1420d\" :answer-field/correct \"bbc4eb12-c082-533c-91e3-42088827c6c9\"] [\"98784736-c266-5208-a6fc-c447c86d139a\" :question/id #uuid \"98784736-c266-5208-a6fc-c447c86d139a\"] [\"98784736-c266-5208-a6fc-c447c86d139a\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{-1}^{1} \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(- \\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6},\\\\quad \\\\arcsin{\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"98784736-c266-5208-a6fc-c447c86d139a\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=2\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\\\cdot 2=2$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=-1&\\\\Longrightarrow u=- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\\\\\x=1&\\\\Longrightarrow u=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{-1}^{1} \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int_{- \\\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}} \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arcsin{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{- \\\\frac{1}{2}}^{\\\\frac{1}{2}}\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2 \\\\pi}{3}.\\n$$\"] [\"98784736-c266-5208-a6fc-c447c86d139a\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"98784736-c266-5208-a6fc-c447c86d139a\" :question/answer-fields \"f8ba04b5-b93a-5fbf-9837-f370a0a1420d\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"98784736-c266-5208-a6fc-c447c86d139a\"] [\"974f4491-1b3e-5162-8762-b997c2ce7d0a\" :answer/id #uuid \"974f4491-1b3e-5162-8762-b997c2ce7d0a\"] [\"974f4491-1b3e-5162-8762-b997c2ce7d0a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"974f4491-1b3e-5162-8762-b997c2ce7d0a\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}\"] [\"7b20481d-efa0-5d19-bace-b463c668fb4a\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"7b20481d-efa0-5d19-bace-b463c668fb4a\"] [\"7b20481d-efa0-5d19-bace-b463c668fb4a\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"7b20481d-efa0-5d19-bace-b463c668fb4a\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"7b20481d-efa0-5d19-bace-b463c668fb4a\" :answer-field/choices \"974f4491-1b3e-5162-8762-b997c2ce7d0a\"] [\"7b20481d-efa0-5d19-bace-b463c668fb4a\" :answer-field/correct \"974f4491-1b3e-5162-8762-b997c2ce7d0a\"] [\"2276b7cb-4dac-5fe2-bb8d-8f1bf4683a99\" :question/id #uuid \"2276b7cb-4dac-5fe2-bb8d-8f1bf4683a99\"] [\"2276b7cb-4dac-5fe2-bb8d-8f1bf4683a99\" :question/problem \"Evaluate exactly.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int_{-2}^{2} \\\\frac{3}{x^{2} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C$.\\n\\nEndpoint values: $\\\\arctan{\\\\left(-1 \\\\right)}=- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4},\\\\quad \\\\arctan{\\\\left(1 \\\\right)}=\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$.\\n\\n{{answer}}\"] [\"2276b7cb-4dac-5fe2-bb8d-8f1bf4683a99\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=\\\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(\\\\frac{1}{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\nx^{2} + 4=4\\\\left(1+(\\\\frac{x}{2})^2\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=2\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\cdot 2=\\\\frac{3}{2}$.\\n\\nTransform both bounds:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}x=-2&\\\\Longrightarrow u=-1\\\\\\\\x=2&\\\\Longrightarrow u=1\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int_{-2}^{2} \\\\frac{3}{x^{2} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int_{-1}^{1} \\\\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\left[\\\\arctan{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right]_{-1}^{1}\\\\right)=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)-\\\\left(- \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}\\\\right)\\\\right).\\n$$\\n\\nThe exact answer is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3 \\\\pi}{4}.\\n$$\"] [\"2276b7cb-4dac-5fe2-bb8d-8f1bf4683a99\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"2276b7cb-4dac-5fe2-bb8d-8f1bf4683a99\" :question/answer-fields \"7b20481d-efa0-5d19-bace-b463c668fb4a\"] [17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions \"2276b7cb-4dac-5fe2-bb8d-8f1bf4683a99\"] [\"ge